The votes are in and today's addition to the Cursed Apple is...

## Silver

[[!:https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/0841efa2500ec2bf46ca991f4df8150748d8defa.png]]((The Curse Beckons for Silver announcement art))

Silver makes her living tracking down lowlifes, but today New York’s misanthrope lycanthrope plans on summoning a god. Fortunately, her career as a bounty hunter has prepared her well for all that the ritual requires. She makes quick work of adversaries by catching them with her __Entangling Bola__, __Boot Kicking__ them in the face, and finishing them off with a __Slam Fire__ from her rifle. But inevitably, the __Lycan Curse__ comes calling whether she likes it or not, and her foes will regret being too close when it does. - __"This should be easy. Won't be, but I'm really good at lying to myself."__

Silver is available to play now! The next hero from the [[https://www.playdeadlock.com/oldgods]]((Old Gods, New Blood)) update will be released on Thursday February 5th at 2pm PST. See you then!